{
  "title": "Modified import BaseButton in AddToCartButton to skip the barrel",
  "diff": [
    "diff --git a/src/views/catalog/components/AddToCartButton.vue b/src/views/catalog/components/AddToCartButton.vue",
    "--- a/src/views/catalog/components/AddToCartButton.vue",
    "+++ b/src/views/catalog/components/AddToCartButton.vue",
    "@@ -2 +2 @@",
    "-import { BaseButton } from \"@/components/ui\"",
    "+import BaseButton from \"@/components/ui/BaseButton.vue\""
  ],
  "codegraph": {
    "segments": [
      {
        "title": "Direct import of BaseButton in AddToCartButton",
        "context": [
          "The add-to-cart button of the catalogue now takes the shared button from the file that declares it. It took the shared button from the index file of the shared components before. A shopper sees the same button, and a click still adds the product to the cart. One import line changes, and nothing that runs.",
          "",
          "## Overview",
          "",
          "- **When** a shopper clicks \"Add to cart\" on a product of the catalogue, **then** nothing changes.",
          "- **When** the cart page, the account page or the theme toggle renders the shared button, **then** nothing changes.",
          "- **When** a tool reads the imports of the add-to-cart button, **then** [it finds the file of the shared button](code:src/views/catalog/components/AddToCartButton.vue#L2), and no longer the index file that also re-exports the dialog and the input.",
          "",
          "## Implementation",
          "",
          "**`src/views/catalog/components/AddToCartButton.vue`**",
          "",
          "- Modified [the import of `BaseButton`](code:src/views/catalog/components/AddToCartButton.vue#L2) to read the default export of `@/components/ui/BaseButton.vue`, the file that declares `BaseButton`. It read the named export `BaseButton` of the barrel `@/components/ui` before."
        ],
